WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:09.340
See every bay on each level live, open a bay to see the car in it, and switch levels.

2
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:15.460
The floor map draws each level of the car park, and updates by itself.

3
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:19.770
Taken, free, held for bookings and out of service.

4
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:26.730
Colours show each bay: free, taken, booked, reserved for VIPs, valet, electric cars and accessible bays.

5
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:31.730
Click a bay to see what is there.

6
00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:40.820
The car, how long it has been there, and actions: report a fine, or take the bay out of service.

7
00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:44.760
Switch to the level below.

8
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:51.410
Where there are no bay sensors, cars are placed nearest the lifts first, as drivers do.
